												"type": "wysiwyg_basic",
												"html": "<h5>Case Management</h5>\n\n<p>\n\tProject FIGHT provides crisis intervention and comprehensive case management for victims of human trafficking in North Carolina. Case managers connect victims to resources such as:\n</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Food, shelter and clothing</li>\n\t<li>Safety planning</li>\n\t<li>Medical care, mental health and dental services</li>\n\t<li>Identification, documentation, education, employment and housing</li>\n\t<li>Immigration/legal assistance and ESL</li>\n</ul>",
